AKB48の私たちの物語｣\n聴いてくださった方、有難うございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメはカメ。\nウサギはウサギ。\nあと、ピーピー鳴くのはピー太郎。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あだ名の付け方。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今話したい誰か..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以前、本気で猫と会話がしたくて、\nアプリを探してみたことがありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたらあったんです、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"｢人猫語翻訳機｣というな！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにやらこのアプリを使うと、\nなんと猫と会話ができるというな！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こりゃすごい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか興奮して野良猫ちゃんを探して散歩してみるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういうときに限って、びっくりするほど\nぜんっぜん猫が現れない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうなるともうただの変な人！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/31/6621189/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来世は猫に生まれたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"  ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日は握手会でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中、雪や雨の中、\nお越しくださった皆さん、\n本当に有難うございました(*__)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、温かくして寝てくださいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/31/6621189/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/31/6621189/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/01/31/6621189/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"